 {reviewing&&<section ref={reviewRef} tabIndex={-1} className="goods-review" aria-label="本单提交核对"><h3>4 · 提交前核对</h3><p>{new Set(lines.map(l=>l.choice.customerName)).size} 个客户 · {lines.length} 项货物 · {inventoryAmount(totalQuantity,totalBoxes,lines.length>0&&lines.every(l=>mode==='inbound'?l.inventoryUnit==='box':isBoxChoice(l.choice)))}</p><p>{mode==='inbound'?'入库日期':'出库日期'} {mode==='inbound'?inboundDate:outboundDate}</p>{lines.map((l,index)=><div key={outboundTaskKey(l)}><b>{l.choice.product} · {l.choice.customerName} · {l.quantity}件 / {l.boxes}箱</b>{mode==='outbound'&&<p>第{index+1}单 · 出库单号：{l.outboundOrder||'未填写'}</p>}{mode==='inbound'&&l.receipt.inboundOrder&&<p>入库单号：{l.receipt.inboundOrder}</p>}{mode==='inbound'?l.placements.map(p=><p key={p.key}>{p.locationCode} · 第 {p.layerCount} 层：{p.quantity}件 / {p.boxes}箱 · {palletLabel(palletCountValue(p.palletCount,1))}托盘 <strong className="goods-marker">{[p.productCondition,p.productPrefix].filter(Boolean).map(v=>v==='good'?'正品':v==='damaged'?'残次品':v).join(' · ')}</strong></p>):Object.entries(l.picks).filter(([,p])=>n(p.quantity)||n(p.boxes)).map(([id,p])=><p key={id}>{(()=>{const row=l.choice.members.find(r=>r.id===Number(id));return row?goodsStockLabel(row):"库位资料待核对";})()} · 本次出库 {p.quantity}件 / {p.boxes}箱 · 托盘{p.pallets?.trim()?p.pallets:'部分保留，出完清零'}</p>)}</div>)}{mode==='outbound'&&canOutbound&&!documentReady&&outboundErrors.some(Boolean)&&<p role="alert">正式出库需核对：{outboundErrors.find(Boolean)}</p>}<p>本单所有货物一并提交；任一项不通过，整单不写入。</p></section>}
